     The RootOK authentication service module for PAM, ppaamm__rroooottookk provides
     functionality for only one PAM category: authentication.  In terms of the
     _m_o_d_u_l_e_-_t_y_p_e parameter, this is the “auth” feature.  It also provides a
     null function for session management.

